  "source_use_rules":[
    "Collective effervescence supports group-emotion mechanisms, not a claim that a forum is a religion.",
    "Girardian mimetic/scapegoat theory must be labeled theoretical/interpretive and balanced with critical literature.",
    "Moral panic should never be used to dismiss a threat merely because attention is intense; compare evidence and proportionality.",
    "Right-to-be-forgotten material supports distinctions among indexing, delisting, deletion and public interest; it does not impose one archive policy everywhere.",
